{"server":"cn","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_st02","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_st02","title":"突然冲击","storyCode":"CV-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"f37bb6084fa99a23fe9a2d5c4161834e1dfaec2493a3d4ea341ea121a721eadc","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"半个月后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"优等生，我们快在这儿傻等一天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总部信使给我们带回来的消息，你应该也看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"消息说他们预计会在明天下午到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"消息上还说，我们需要提前一天准备接驳需要的各项事宜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达维镇的接驳功能本来就没什么问题，罗拉花了半天就全准备好了，然后我们就带着所有人在这儿干站着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你觉得太冷，随时可以去那边临时搭的帐篷里烤烤火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果我不是觉得冷，而是......害怕呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，我只是......不知道达维镇的事到底会怎么收场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷蛇略显焦躁地把通讯器贴到耳边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有可接收的信号，这证明那艘被黑钢干员们称为“本舰”的巴伦基地还未进入通讯的范围。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，不再烤一会儿火了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了......天马上就要黑了，无论如何都会觉得冷的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，你也别太担心，虽然银行确实让人生气，但本舰马上就要来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板可不会让银行那些家伙骑到我们头上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老板？哪个老板？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还能有哪个老板，克里夫先生啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也说不好，毕竟......说到底克里夫先生是个生意人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰西卡沉默着看向平台的方向，手习惯性地伸进口袋，摩挲着其中的子弹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......杰西卡，你看那里，是不是有火光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就地块上，靠近矿厂厂区的部分，可能是取暖失火了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，不对，起火点不止一个......这、这究竟......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......小队，黑钢......舰预计将在......后到达......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，你去告诉大家——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"队长，地块上有数个起火点，不知道出了什么问题，我得去看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么偏偏是这种时候......但我们已经收到了本舰发来的信号，巴伦基地离我们已经不远了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡——杰西卡！你到底要去哪？！队长，怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让她去吧......我们继续接驳任务。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么声音啊，大晚上的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里来的动静......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在砸动力炉？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伍德洛将枕头下的铳械摸出，凝神细听从楼下传来的响动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，快下来！有人闯进来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g7_sonwydowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呕......难受死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道......就不喝那么多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"困死了，就地躺倒算了......这样明早肯定就在街边冻硬实了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音......怎么回事......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这怎么回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢工程小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老、老伯你快走，这里......唔、这些人突然闯了进来......又砸又抢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......原来是你啊，老爷子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是当时雪地上的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我命很大的......老爷子，嘘，千万不要声张，会引来其他人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷子，当时你很幸运，从我手中逃过一劫，不知道现在还有没有这个运气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢工程小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老伯，快走！你一个人对付不了的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老家伙，你居然也在这儿啊。不错，省得一会儿再去找你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海伦娜，怎么回事？我以为等我下楼，这里已经躺满你打倒的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们这次胆子大了不少，大概是真疯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位别自顾自说悄悄话啊，有什么好消息不如讲出来一起分享一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是不知天高地厚的崽子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老家伙，那些子弹一定很珍贵吧，珍贵到......你连一个六发的弹巢都没有装满。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想想也是，这地块上供你用的材料也没有几样啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，这么多年了，你天天拿着那把铳，怎么几乎没听说过你给谁来上一梭子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟们，先把这两个老家伙放倒，然后就当这里是自己家，看上什么就拿吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g7_sonwydowntown_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些人，干......干什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作乱的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醉鬼，让开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁、谁让你在......在这里闹事的，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作乱的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，我再请你喝一瓶，你好好睡一觉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闹事的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥，真有你的，醉鬼就该往他脸上来一酒瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作乱的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闹事的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"东西拿够了，我们去下一家？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂，你还好吗......我先扶你起来？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这群小崽子下手真狠，你脸上全是血......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事......就是头晕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这店里面怎么也被砸成这样......他们不光砸了橱窗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"何止是橱窗......他们几乎把我抢干净了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚到底怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷子，我们时间很紧的，就别玩捉迷藏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这儿对不对！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烦死人了，这地方又狭窄，障碍物又多，根本施展不开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以别他妈到处乱窜了，老不死的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个腿脚，居然还能避开这一下，真是小瞧你了。看看运气能眷顾你到什么时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，终于逮到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能死在这破地方也挺好，和你很配。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（就再来一下......坚持住，你这把老骨头，能行的......一定能行。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于可以和你说再见了，老头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想得美......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的，混蛋，你完了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狡诈的混混","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么......蒸汽？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好烫——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的没错，这破地方可是我的家啊，当然和我很配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......没人可以在我家闹事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的混混","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是自找的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。我的弹巢确实不满，为了让它们能在我的铳里击发，我也确实花了不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......我不会把子弹用在你们身上，太不值了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"将手铳收回腰间的皮套，老人解开了袖扣，将袖子挽高露出手臂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧，伍迪......都这把年纪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有多长时间没看我用绳圈了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从你把地块外面那些牧兽都卖给商队换物资......大概三四年了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，才三四年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去收拾领头那几个家伙，剩下的你能搞定吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点的好......离天亮还早，能再倒头睡一觉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，附近没有几棵树能把你们吊起来，不过房檐下......也不是不行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，都把我们围得水泄不通了，还没人敢打头阵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别得意，老东西，还有你好看的呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们最近都听说了什么？今晚到底怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我就剩这些绷带了，不够缠的，你先拿着捂在脑袋上吧......要不然血淋淋的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，你说你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"最初是从地块东边传来的消息，你也知道，不务正业的小流氓都聚在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"说是镇子里有很多人都觉得，反正怎么也还不上银行的钱，不如......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不如狠狠抢一笔......逃去拓荒地重新开始......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你也看见了，刚刚他们跟疯了一样，到处打人、砸店、抢劫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄的店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，里昂，快来看，那是......你家的方向......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......该死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g4_bank"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"经理，我、我......听起来外面的情况不太好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可放心，西尔维娅，在这间银行里，我们每一个人的安全都有保障。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们确实是些无药可救的家伙，只有在我们面前，才不得不变成懂得分寸的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你实在害怕，可以干脆睡一觉。一觉醒来之后，他们就再也不会出现在你的视野里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这是......什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人没告诉你吗？我们的合作伙伴即将到来，这些家伙马上就要没用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，他们主动提出临走前带点土特产再出发，我们也没理由不默许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只需要等待就好，就像我们之前无数次做过的那样，耐心等待，该来的都会来的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"经理，我们收到通讯了，是来自黑钢的！他们的本舰提前到达了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，不光来了，还来得早了一些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，对我们来说，都是一样的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g1_mine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来上次去找你，你还是没记住教训。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的......呸，每次都说是教训，都说是警告，你哪次动过真格的啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是非想挨子弹，我也可以满足你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自己选下一处吧，左脚还是左手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你根本不知道......就算逃过了我们......逃过了今天......还会有别人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们一个都别想逃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与其操心我们，不如先想想自己吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蛮横的混混","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g8_abandonedblock"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无措的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快救火！救火啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，里昂先生在里面吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无措的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不知道，我出来的时候房子已经烧起来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让一下，女士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无措的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子你、你这是去干什么？！你不能进去，火势这么大，你出不来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，你快去找更多人来灭火吧，我先进去找里昂先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无措的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这孩子，他是你什么人啊，要你这么豁出命去救他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识他的，女士你就松开我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无措的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是认识而已，非亲非故的，你不要命了！哎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，你怎么会在这里？你、你这是干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没在里面啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了，杰西卡，看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无措的地块居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂先生，这孩子一直说要进火场去找你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我以为你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......孩子，你别哭了，我还活得好好的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你、你的房子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的......没事......我可以去海伦娜那里住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，家里只有我一个人，天天望着空荡荡的墙壁，心里也难受......烧了也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后就......再也不惦记了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办......怎么办......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办？我都说了，烧了就烧了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办，怎么办，怎么办......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，杰西卡，什么怎么办？到底出什么事了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g11_blacksteelplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢资深干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蒂拉，我看你来来回回进出克里夫先生的办公室，难道雷蛇小队失手了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢情报小组成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，虽然地块上确实出现了一些突发情况，但雷蛇小队完成了他们的任务，本舰马上就要和达维镇对接了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢资深干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了，那些欠债的人知道我们来了之后肯定没他们的好处，所以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢情报小组成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请谨言慎行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢资深干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我的错我的错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢资深干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过克里夫先生怎么说？该不会因为有人闹事就改主意了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢情报小组成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1040_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切按原计划执行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢资深干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢资深干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来我们终于快要到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"起初，是一缕异样的空气，拂动了人们的发丝。\n接着，是一阵从每个人脚底传来的震动。\n最后，是一声从数百米外的高空传来的巨大轰鸣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i04"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i04"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"冲破冬夜浓重的雾气，经过半个月的行驶后，巴伦基地抵达了。\n所有人聚在街头，站在窗口，看向它驶来的方向。\n无论人们是欢迎，或是抗拒，它都来了。\n无论今夜是噩梦，还是美梦，都惊醒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g1_mine"},{"type":"narration","text":"掂了掂手中的铳械，事情做到一半被打断，让伍德洛心里很不高兴。\n将目光从远处的舰船上收回，伍德洛看到地上的男人早已不见踪影，只留下一行长长的血迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......刚刚应该先冲他的脚来颗子弹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
